This repository distributes Undominated.ai public software, resource
instructions, documentation and brand images. Component software licences
are listed below; the whole repository is not licensed under MIT.

© 2026 Len van der Hof.

You may quote this README with attribution to Undominated.ai
(https://undominated.ai/). The name, the Dual Witness mark, and the
chartreuse evidence shard identify the live index. They are not a licence
to republish the catalogue.

This repository does not contain the full live model catalogue. Dated
examples, generated figures and snapshot links are identified as such; the
current catalogue lives on https://undominated.ai/. LMArena leaderboard
data is CC BY 4.0 from the official dataset. Artificial Analysis scores
are excluded from this repository's public tool outputs; redistribution
rights remain unresolved and this repository grants no sublicence to them.

